# el1011-q-tile 2026-10-11 RELAUNCH 2: qfd_tile_lsl4 = qfd_tile_lsl3 with the M2-M6 limit actually applied. lsl3's '--routing-layers M2 M6' in EXTRA was overridden by route_master.sh's later '--routing-layers ${RLAYERS:-M2 M7}' (config.mk MAX_ROUTING_LAYER=M7, GRT-0021 M7): 54 signal nets on M7, 2102 M7 OBS rects, 448 over the M6 power pins (median 51% of each pin's strap-via sites blocked) = UPDATE 3 failure mode. RLAYERS sets the limit.
# el1011-q-tile 2026-10-11 UPDATE 2: qfd_tile_lsl3 = qfd_tile_lsl2 with signal routing M2-M6 (M7 left free over the leaf so the parent M7 straps via onto its M6 power pins; exact-shape abstract, no bloat: PDN-0006 on NO3).
# el1011-q-tile 2026-10-11 round 2: qfd_tile_lsl2 = qfd_tile_lsl_iof (CLOSED TT +170.77 / FF +19.21) re-aspected to 99.792 x 140.4 um (util ~0.59): 2 cols x 4 rows in y 235-887 with 23.5 um edge strips for the die pin flops, a 20 um spine and the landing corridor y 900-1098 kept free.
# el1011-q-tile 2026-10-11: qfd_tile_lsl + every IO pin flop (S3 copies) fixed at its pin (tile_pre_gpl.tcl / io_flop_at_pins; class 3, rpxc FF I2R window 710 on unanchored pin flops).
# el1011-q-tile 2026-10-11 TEXTBOOK REBUILD round 1 (classes 1 / 2 / 4): qfd_tile_lsl = ONE hardened lane-slice leaf of the
# W12 ROM tile engine (ot_qwen_w12_lane_slice, ot_qwen_w12_matvec_part HIER=2): 2 lane positions x 4 groups = 8 lanes
# (BF16 product + FP32 accumulator) + their whole 2-level split tree (6 adders), ~10.8k flops, its own clock tree, valid /
# first lines, split delay and reset relay.  Boundary: every input lands on a pin flop that IS the engine's S3 register;
# outputs are the last tree register.  The flat tile was one 138k-sink clock tree over 267 x 1292 um (CTS skew 226 ps).
# 8 instances per tile (2 columns x 4 rows in the middle band, mirrored so the pin side faces the central spine).
TOP=ot_qwen_tile_lsl
SRCS='rtl/physical/ot_qwen_tile_lsl.sv rtl/hdc/ot_qwen_w12_matvec.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_matvec.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fpu.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fp32_mul_pipe.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fastfp.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_delay.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_sfu.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fp32_add_lat.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fp32_mul_lat.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_prefix.sv rtl/hdc/ot_qwen_w12_arith.sv rtl/proto/ot_fp32_add_rne_pipe.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fp32_add_lat_nr.sv'
PARAMS=()
FW=99.792
FH=140.4
PINS=(--pin-region '^(clk|rst_n|v_d|first_d|split_d)(\[|$)=right:62-78' --pin-region '^x_d(\[|$)=right:78-100' --pin-region '^w_d(\[|$)=right:6-62' --pin-region '^(t_out|lfault|tfault)(\[|$)=right:104-134')
INTER=''
REFGLOB='*s3_*'
SDCF=die_p770.sdc
PD=0.50
NC=16
PIN_H='M4 M6'
PIN_V='M5'
STAGES=synth,pnr
EXTRA=(--step-tcl PRE_GLOBAL_PLACE=physical/qwen_die_masters/tile_pre_gpl.tcl --step-tcl PRE_DETAIL_PLACE=physical/qwen_die_masters/tile_pre_dpl.tcl)
RLAYERS='M2 M6'
